[00:00.76]As Jehovah’s people sound throughout the earth
[00:06.94]Truths about the Kingdom and its priceless worth,
[00:12.90]Theocratic order they must all obey
[00:19.16]And remain united, loyalty display.
[00:25.33](Chorus)
[00:25.48]Loyal submission in recognition,
[00:31.48]This to our God we owe.
[00:37.64]He gives protection, tender affection,
[00:43.58]Loyalty to him we show.
[00:48.74]God provides his steward and his active force.
[00:56.14]These will ever guide us in our Christian course.
[01:02.24]So may we be steadfast, seeking God to please,
[01:08.44]Loyally proclaiming all his wise decrees!
[01:14.49](Chorus)
[01:14.64]Loyal submission in recognition,
[01:20.68]This to our God we owe.
